      "content": "that makes sense, but i'm worried about how \"unaided memory\" is interpreted. if i'm working on a really complex system and i just happen to remember a specific architectural way of structuring the data because it was such a core part of the project, does that count as residuals? i don't want to get sued just because i'm a good engineer and remember how i solved things.",
